							<p align="center"><img src="http://img.photobucket.com/albums/v511/Amyana/Site%20Related%20Misc/siteassistance.jpg" /></p> <p><font color="#7fffd4">If you're having any problems with anything on the site, skim this page before you do anything else.&nbsp; If you're still having problems, go to the </font><a href="http://pub43.bravenet.com/faq/show.php?usernum=3670932698"><font color="#7fffd4">FAQ </font></a><font color="#7fffd4">button, and post your question.</font><br /><font color="#0000ff"><strong></strong></font></p> <ul> <li><strong>The Buttons</strong> <li><strong></strong><strong>Forum Help</strong> <ul> <li><strong></strong><strong>Registering and Passwords</strong> </li></ul> <ul> <li><strong>Signatures and Avatars</strong> </li></ul> <ul> <li><strong>Posting</strong> </li></ul> <li><strong>Profile Help</strong> <li><strong>Photos</strong> <ul> <li><strong>Image Management</strong> </li></ul> <li><strong>Contact Information</strong> <li><strong>Fonts</strong></li></ul><font color="#0000ff"><strong> <p><br /></p></strong></font> <p align="center"><font face="Georgia" color="#7fffd4" size="5"><strong>The Buttons:</strong></font></p> <ul> <li><font color="#ee82ee"><strong>Home</strong>: </font>Takes you to the main page <li><font color="#ee82ee"><strong>Roster</strong>: </font>Shows the list of members, and some general info about them, including their DKP, email and the number of raids they have attended. <li><font color="#ee82ee"><strong>Raids</strong>: </font>Shows every raid we've done.&nbsp; This page is accessible by members only. <li><font color="#ee82ee"><strong>Images</strong>: </font>Shows some screenshots of different members, raids and events. <li><font color="#ee82ee"><strong>Loot</strong>: </font>Shows items won during raids.&nbsp; This page is accessible by members only. <li><font color="#ee82ee"><strong>Guild Bank</strong>: </font>All gear that is in the guild bank.&nbsp; This page is accessible by members only. <li><font color="#ee82ee"><strong>Guild Spells</strong>:</font> All spells that are in the guild bank.&nbsp; This page is accessible by members only. <li><font color="#ee82ee"><strong>Forums</strong>: </font>Our Message board. <li><font color="#ee82ee"><strong>Applications</strong>: </font>An application form for applying for membership to the guild. <li><font color="#ee82ee"><strong>Login</strong>: </font>Where you login at. <li><font color="#ee82ee"><strong>For Members</strong>:</font> A page with links of other pages on the site.&nbsp; This page is accessible by members only.&nbsp; <li><font color="#ee82ee"><strong>Rules</strong>:&nbsp; </font>This is a list of rules for our members to follow.&nbsp; This is a public page. <li><font color="#ee82ee"><strong>New Members</strong>:&nbsp;</font> This page describes our recruitment policies.&nbsp; This is a public page. <li><font color="#ee82ee"><strong>Our Officers</strong>:&nbsp; </font>This page describes our officer policies.&nbsp; This is a public page. <li><font color="#ee82ee">Raid Rules:</font>&nbsp; This page describes our rules for raiding.&nbsp; There are links on this page to a couple different guides to further help with raiding.&nbsp; This page is viewable by members only. <ul> <li><font color="#ee82ee">Raid Guide:&nbsp; </font>This page is a general guide to raids, it contains information about different raid commands, ect. <li><font color="#ee82ee">Healers Guide to Raiding:&nbsp; </font>This page was written by Amyana, and is a guide to help healers during raids.<br /></li></ul> <li><font color="#ee82ee"><strong>FAQ</strong>:&nbsp; </font>This is the Frequently Asked Questions page.&nbsp; This is a good page to check out if you're having problems, you can post your own questions here as well.&nbsp; This is a public page. <li><font color="#ee82ee"><strong>Server Status</strong>:&nbsp;</font> This is a link to Sony's Server Status page.&nbsp; This is a public page. <li><font color="#ee82ee"><strong>Awards</strong>:&nbsp; </font>The awards we offer to our members.&nbsp; This is a public page. <li><font color="#ee82ee"><strong>Epic Guides</strong>:&nbsp; </font>Guides for each classe's epic quest.&nbsp; This is a public page. <li><font color="#ee82ee"><strong>Links</strong>:&nbsp; </font>Links to our favorite websites.&nbsp; Anyone can add a link here.&nbsp; This is a public page. <li><font color="#ee82ee"><strong>Guestbook</strong>:&nbsp; </font>Sign our guestbook! <li><font color="#ee82ee"><strong>Photos</strong>:&nbsp; </font>Real life photos of our members, their families and pets.&nbsp; There is also a section here for you to post screenshots of your user-interfaces.&nbsp; This is a public page. <li><font color="#ee82ee"><strong>Wall of Heros</strong>:</font>&nbsp; Winners of our awards. </li></ul> <p align="center"><font face="Georgia" color="#7fffd4" size="5"><strong>Forum Help</strong></font></p> <p><font face="Georgia" color="#7fffd4"><strong>Registering and Passwords</strong></font></p> <ul> <li>Current members are registered to the forums automatically when they are added to the player roster.&nbsp; Their username is their character name, you can receive your password by&nbsp;emailing me. &nbsp;Members should changed their password as soon as they are able to do so. <li>If you lose your password, send a pm or an email to me, and I'll reset it to the default password. <li>Non-members may register to the forums on the forums page.&nbsp; I suggest that you do not use your character name as your username if you're planning to join the guild.&nbsp; If you have any problems accessing a forum that you should have access to, send a private message or an email to Amyana.</li></ul> <p><font face="Georgia" color="#7fffd4"><strong>Signatures and Avatars</strong></font></p> <ul> <li>All users are allowed signatures and avatars.&nbsp; The pictures will need to be remotely hosted in order for them to work.&nbsp; Please make sure that your signatures and avatars are tasteful, and not vulgar or obscene in any way.&nbsp; You can update your signatures, avatars and other information in the Control Panel, located along the top&nbsp;of the forums. <li><a href="/custom.aspx?pid=1597">Custom Signature Guide</a></li></ul> <p><font face="Georgia" color="#7fffd4"><strong>Posting</strong></font></p> <ul> <li>Cursing and other inappropriate language is not acceptable on the forums.&nbsp; I will edit any language that I feel is inappropriate. <li>Bashing people in the forums is not acceptable.&nbsp; Play nice. <li>You can send a private message (pm) to any user on the site.&nbsp; You can access this along the top bar of the forums, next to the Control Panel button.</li></ul> <h4><br /></h4> <p align="center"><font face="Georgia" color="#7fffd4" size="5"><strong>Profile Help</strong></font></p> <ul> <li>Your character profile contains such editable information as: <ul> <li dir="ltr" style="MARGIN-RIGHT: 0px">your character's level <li dir="ltr" style="MARGIN-RIGHT: 0px">your character's race <li dir="ltr" style="MARGIN-RIGHT: 0px">your character's class <li dir="ltr" style="MARGIN-RIGHT: 0px">your character's sex <li dir="ltr" style="MARGIN-RIGHT: 0px">your character's AA points <li dir="ltr" style="MARGIN-RIGHT: 0px">your character's magelo profile link <li dir="ltr" style="MARGIN-RIGHT: 0px">your character's picture <li dir="ltr" style="MARGIN-RIGHT: 0px">your alternate characters <li dir="ltr" style="MARGIN-RIGHT: 0px">your email address <li dir="ltr" style="MARGIN-RIGHT: 0px">a short biography</li></ul> <li style="MARGIN-RIGHT: 0px">To update your character's picture, take a screenshot in the game.&nbsp; This can be done, at least on my computer, by pressing the - that is above the + on your number pad.&nbsp; The image, (again this is on my computer) is dropped your everquest folder, under a folder titled Screenshots.&nbsp; By default this image is saved as a gif image, it may be necassary to convert the image to jpeg format in order to upload it to the site. If you have any problems getting the image to upload, email it to me, along with your password, and i'll do it for you.&nbsp; The image can be found: C://programfiles/sony/everquest/screenshots</li></ul> <p align="center"><font face="Georgia" color="#7fffd4" size="5"><strong>Photos</strong></font></p> <ul> <li style="MARGIN-RIGHT: 0px">You may upload photos of yourself, your family, your pets, or anything else that is important to you under the photos link.&nbsp; It may be necessary to resize the image.&nbsp; After you submit your photo, I have to view the image, and upload it to the site.&nbsp; This is to ensure that noone enters naughty photos...&nbsp; <li style="MARGIN-RIGHT: 0px">There is a folder on this page for you to upload screenshots of your userinterface.&nbsp; The screenshots are too large, but will fit if you resize them by half.</li></ul> <p><font face="Georgia" color="#7fffd4"><strong>Image Managment</strong></font></p> <ul> <li style="MARGIN-RIGHT: 0px">To resize an image, open the image in whichever image editor you use.&nbsp; Common programs are paint, photo editor,ect.&nbsp; Resize the image, by percentages.&nbsp; Some programs have this option under page settings.&nbsp; <li>To change an images format, open the image in whichever image editor you use.&nbsp; It may be necassary to open gif images in Paint, although I'm not sure on that.&nbsp; Rename the image, and change the extension, voila!<br /></li></ul> <p align="center"><font face="Georgia" color="#7fffd4" size="5"><strong>Contact Information</strong></font></p> <p>The site's email address is <a href="mailto:Moonlite_redemption@yahoo.com">Moonlite_redemption@yahoo.com</a></p> <p>To email an officer: <a href="mailto:mlredemption@yahoo.com">mlredemption@yahoo.com</a></p> <p><font face="Georgia" color="#0000ff"><strong>Fonts</strong></font></p> <div class="newsBody"> <p><img src="/pics/1602/Fonts.gif" /><strong><font face="Georgia" color="#0000ff" size="2">&nbsp; (Clicking this image on a page, will let you download that page's font free)</font></strong></p> <p>Download all the Fonts on this site </p> <p><a href="http://www.grsites.com/modperl/fontview.cgi?dir=c&amp;fn=CELTG___"><font color="#99ccff">Celtic Garamond the 2nd</font></a></p> <p><a href="http://www.pfonts.com/m/index3.shtml#">Magik</a></p> <p><a href="http://www.grsites.com/modperl/fontview.cgi?dir=a&amp;fn=AUNTJUDY">Aunt Judy</a></p> <p><a href="http://www.grsites.com/modperl/fontview.cgi?dir=a&amp;fn=ARGOS">Argos</a></p> <p><a href="http://www.grsites.com/modperl/fontview.cgi?dir=m&amp;fn=MICHAEL">Michaelmas</a></p> <p><a href="http://www.grsites.com/modperl/fontview.cgi?dir=q&amp;fn=QUILL_S">QuillScript</a></p> <p><a href="http://www.grsites.com/modperl/fontview.cgi?dir=s&amp;fn=SCRIPTIN">Scriptina</a></p> <p>&nbsp;</p></div>
							
